Generated by \`scripts/setup-phase-1.sh\`. Identifiers and secret *names* only; secret values live in Vaultwarden (\`nunio-staging\`, \`nunio-prod\`) and, from Phase 2, in platform secret stores.

| Service | Staging | Production | Region |
