| Domain | \`app.staging.${PRODUCT_DOMAIN:-nunio.app}\` / \`api.staging.${PRODUCT_DOMAIN:-nunio.app}\` | \`app.${PRODUCT_DOMAIN:-nunio.app}\` / \`api.${PRODUCT_DOMAIN:-nunio.app}\` | registrar: ${DOMAIN_REGISTRAR:-?} |
| GitHub | environment \`staging\` | environment \`production\` | repo \`${REPO:-unknown}\` |
| Vercel | team \`${VERCEL_TEAM_SLUG:-?}\` (\`${VERCEL_ORG_ID:-?}\`) | same team | \`fra1\` (set per project) |
| Render | workspace \`${RENDER_WORKSPACE_ID:-?}\` | same workspace | frankfurt |
| Neon | project \`${NEON_PROJECT_ID:-?}\`, branch \`staging\` | branch \`production\`, scale-to-zero off | aws-eu-central-1, PG ${NEON_PG_VERSION:-?}, restore window ${NEON_RESTORE_WINDOW_DAYS:-?} d |
| Temporal Cloud | \`${TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE_STAGING:-?}\` (\`${TEMPORAL_ADDRESS_STAGING:-?}\`) | \`${TEMPORAL_NAMESPACE_PROD:-?}\` (\`${TEMPORAL_ADDRESS_PROD:-?}\`) | aws-eu-central-1, retention 7 d |
| Hetzner | project \`${HETZNER_PROJECT:-?}\`, credentials \`nunio-staging\` | credentials \`nunio-prod\` | fsn1 (\`${HETZNER_S3_ENDPOINT:-?}\`) |
| OpenRouter (interim AI) | org \`${OPENROUTER_ORG:-?}\`, key \`nunio-staging\` | key \`nunio-prod\` | \`${OPENROUTER_BASE_URL:-https://eu.openrouter.ai/api/v1}\`, EU guardrail, ZDR enforced |
| AWS (future Bedrock) | account \`${AWS_ACCOUNT_BEDROCK_STAGING:-not created}\` | account \`${AWS_ACCOUNT_BEDROCK_PROD:-not created}\` | ${AWS_BEDROCK_REGION:-eu-central-1}; unused until the switch back to Bedrock |

## Secret names

| Name | Where | Used by |
|---|---|---|
| \`VERCEL_TOKEN\` | GitHub repo secret | CI deploys |
| \`VERCEL_ORG_ID\` | GitHub repo variable | CI deploys |
| \`RENDER_API_KEY\` | GitHub repo secret | CI deploys |
| \`DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED\` | GitHub environment secret (staging, production) | CI migrations |
| Neon pooled \`DATABASE_URL\` | Vaultwarden → Vercel api, Render worker (Phase 2) | runtime |
| Temporal API keys | Vaultwarden → Vercel api, Render worker (Phase 2) | runtime |
| Hetzner S3 credentials | Vaultwarden → Vercel api, Render worker (Phase 2) | runtime |
| OpenRouter API keys | Vaultwarden → Vercel api, Render worker (Phase 2) | runtime |
| Master keys \`storage-wrap-*-${MASTER_KEY_VERSION:-v1}\`, \`temporal-codec-*-${MASTER_KEY_VERSION:-v1}\` | Vaultwarden → Vercel api, Render worker (Phase 2) | runtime |

## Deferred to Phase 2

- Vercel projects (\`apps/web\`, \`apps/api\`) and Render services (\`worker\`, \`parser\`), plus copying runtime secrets into them.
